    {"q": "Roughly what share of cancers is due to an inherited high-risk variant?", "o": ["Less than 1 %", "5-10 %", "40-50 %", "Over 80 %"], "a": 1, "x": "About 5 to 10 %. Most are due to changes acquired during life.", "tema": "salud"},
