    {"q": "Before treatment with 5-fluorouracil or capecitabine, the European Medicines Agency recommends testing for…", "o": ["Blood group", "DPD enzyme deficiency", "The BRCA gene", "The karyotype"], "a": 1, "x": "DPD deficiency can cause severe or fatal toxicity with these drugs.", "tema": "salud"},
    {"q": "Who carried out the pea experiments that laid the foundations of heredity?", "o": ["Charles Darwin", "Gregor Mendel", "Thomas H. Morgan", "Louis Pasteur"], "a": 1, "x": "Mendel published his results in 1866. They were rediscovered in 1900.", "tema": "historia"},
