    {"q": "In what year was Watson and Crick's double-helix model published?", "o": ["1944", "1953", "1962", "1977"], "a": 1, "x": "In April 1953, in Nature. The Nobel Prize followed in 1962.", "tema": "historia"},
    {"q": "Who first isolated DNA, in 1869?", "o": ["Friedrich Miescher", "Gregor Mendel", "Oswald Avery", "Erwin Chargaff"], "a": 0, "x": "Miescher called it \"nuclein\". Its function took 75 years to be understood.", "tema": "historia"},
